gle_v2_for_eng whole-course plan, job cs #107, 16 Nov 2026. A PLAN ONLY: nothing here was applied, and no script here can apply (dry.py has no apply mode).

Hand-written, does not regenerate:
  cuts.txt              the target LEGO cut for every seed 1-300 that needs a hand decision (format in build.py's header; family tag after "##")
