  phrase-subs.json      course-wide phrase rewordings that follow a seed-text correction
  doc-front.md, doc-back.md, summary.md   the prose of the two published documents
  build.py mkops.py gendoc.py assemble.py dry.py mkcourse.py show.py cover.py syl.py   the tools

Regenerates:
  live-snapshot.json    python3 mkcourse.py <saved answer of GET :3470/api/production/gle_v2_for_eng/seeds>  (read 16 Nov; course last edited 12 Nov 12:47Z)
