For whoever applies it (a separate job, only on Kai's yes):
  - the expect values in ops.json match the course as of 16 Nov; re-run mkcourse/build/mkops against a fresh read first
  - one request with all 1,880 ops did not answer within 300 s; send it per seed (ops carry "_seed"; strip that key), ascending
  - Popty has no op to re-order LEGOs inside a seed (lego_index is not settable): 75 seeds are flagged order_differs in knockons.json
  - 129 new LEGOs have under 4 practice phrases (baskets.json "thin"); 383 phrases sit in baskets that no longer play ("dark")
  - word tiles (decompositions) are not recomputed by edit-batch: POST /api/admin/recompute-decompositions afterwards (see ops/gle-v2-403/README.md)
  - open items not in ops.json: "we don't want" at seed 50, the 36 non-I "scíth a ligean" rows, fuller baskets, intros

